  {
   "commentary": {
    "commtxt": "B0$ - We enjoyed it, we've been together for the last week and have had good game time. Fakhar and Naeem were excellent in the powerplay with the batting. We struggled a bit in the middle overs, but this is just the start of a tournament and we have plenty of firepower. Mustafizur and I started at the same time for the Qalandars and we're back together. Rauf has been good for us - we've made changes to the playing XI at times and it's worked. That's my job, when I'm batting, I try to build momentum for the team. We wanted to take wickets and build the pressure.",
    "timestamp": 1774549136417,
    "overnum": 0,
    "inningsid": 2,
    "eventtype": "NONE",
