  {
   "commentary": {
    "commtxt": "B0$ - It's the first hit out for the team; there are lots of lessons to learn. The spinners dragged it back in the middle overs, which was positive, but the batting struggled. We lost wickets in the powerplay and couldn't regain momentum. There are a lot of things that need to go right in a 200-run chase, need partnerships to develop. The conservativeness came down because of the loss of 3-4 wickets, the outfield was fast and there was value for shots.",
    "timestamp": 1774549087008,
    "overnum": 0,
    "inningsid": 2,
    "eventtype": "NONE",
