  {
   "commentary": {
    "commtxt": "B0$ - To be honest, I wasn't at my best and the wicket wasn't easy to bat on. I was lucky to score those runs and the bowlers were excellent. I was talking to Naeem, the message sent to the dressing room was that the wicket wasn't easy. We needed wickets in hand to score big in the death overs. Naeem made it easy for me - the plan was simple - he would take the attack to the bowlers and I wait for the bad balls. he's a special talent and I enjoyed batting with him.",
    "timestamp": 1774549027463,
