  {
   "commentary": {
    "commtxt": "B0$ A convincing win for the defending champions and a humbling loss for the newcomers - PSL 2026 has started with a one-sided affair. Chasing 200 was always going to be tough and the Kingsmen struggled right from the onset. They needed some big partnerships, but 25 for the opening wicket was their best stand. Marnus Labuschagne's laboured 26 was the top score, and they never looked competitive in the chase. Every bowler took atleast one wicket as the defending champions started their title defence on a canter. Stay tuned for the presentations.",
