  {
   "commentary": {
    "commtxt": "Mustafizur Rahman to Riley Meredith, B0$ Mohammad Ali Run Out!! A run-out to end the match? There's a direct hit at the striker's end with Mohammad Ali scrambling to make his ground - he's caught a yard short and Qalandars complete a 69-run win to begin their PSL 2026 campaign. Was short and at the body, Meredith was shaping to pull and the ball rolled to Ubaid at short fine, he shies and makes a direct hit, catching Mohammad Ali well short. B1$,",
